<title>USA: N.C. $195 mln bonds won by First Union Capital.</title>
<headline>N.C. $195 mln bonds won by First Union Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union Capital Markets Corp said Wednesday it won $195 million North Carolina full faith and credit bonds at a net interest cost of 5.080 percent.</p>
</text>
